# =====================================================================
#  Protective .gitignore
#
#  This Git repository's root is the user's HOME directory
#  (C:\Users\Steve).  To prevent accidentally committing personal data,
#  secrets, registry hives, browser profiles, etc., we IGNORE EVERYTHING
#  by default and then explicitly UN-IGNORE only the project files.
#
#  To track a new file, add a matching "!path" line below.
# =====================================================================

# Ignore everything, at every directory level.
*

# --- always keep these ---
!.gitignore
!README.md

# --- shared Claude Code working rules (folder in, ONLY this one file) ---
#     NOTE: never whitelist other .claude/ contents — they hold auth tokens.
!.claude/
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# --- MMBasic / PicoW program sources (repo root) ---
!AnalogClock.bas
!LCD_Life.bas
!PicoScope.bas
!TwoTrace.bas
!PicoWClockDST.bas
!PicoWeather.bas

# --- serial tooling (allow the folder, then only these scripts) ---
!tools/
!tools/xmodem_send.py
!tools/xmodem_recv.py
!tools/serial_script.py
!tools/start_program.py
!tools/validate_run.py
!tools/psp_open.vbs
!tools/PaintShopPro8.Image.backup.reg
# Realtek headphone-jack fix (script, task setup, and the "Fix Headphones" popup/icon; not the rendered PNGs)
!tools/restart_realtek_audio.ps1
!tools/register_audio_task.ps1
!tools/harden_audio_task.ps1
!tools/headphones_icon/
!tools/headphones_icon/headphones.svg
!tools/headphones_icon/headphones.ico
!tools/headphones_icon/make_ico.py
!tools/headphones_icon/make_shortcut.ps1
!tools/headphones_icon/FixHeadphones.vbs
!tools/headphones_icon/HeadphonesStatus.ps1
# "Switch Display" app: detect the external monitor and switch to it (not preview.png or the run log)
!tools/display_switch/
!tools/display_switch/SwitchToExternal.ps1
!tools/display_switch/SwitchDisplay.vbs
!tools/display_switch/display.svg
!tools/display_switch/display.ico
!tools/display_switch/make_ico.py
!tools/display_switch/make_shortcut.ps1

# --- ESP32-S3 MicroPython clock+weather (NEVER track secrets.py / key.pem) ---
